  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Professionalization of Empirical Teachers in RACS Phase VII</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Many primary teachers in the Caribbean Coast lack formal qualification to deliver education with quality and pertinent to the multi-ethnic society of the Caribbean Coast. The objective of the project is to provide intercultural teacher training to primary teachers without formal education, so that children and youth may receive education in their mother languages and with a curriculum adequate to their socioenvironmental contexts.</narrative>
  </description>
